| Package | Role | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| `zstandard` | the only runtime dependency — the core baseline codec | BSD-3-Clause |
| `PySide6` | the optional `[gui]` extra | `LGPL-3.0-only OR GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0` |
| `py7zr` | benchmark harness only — PPMd baseline | licence field empty in the PyPI metadata read; the wheel's own `LICENSE` is the authority |
